									<h3 class="h3">Smart Match<br />Capability</h3>
									<div class="sticky-par">
										<p class="paragraph">Find immigration support that fits your exact situation.
											Our system helps you quickly explore trusted information, sponsorship
											friendly employers, and legal pathways tailored to your visa type, country
											of origin, and career goals.</p>
									</div><a href="#contact-us" data-w-id="b75f9825-e88d-210d-e068-14e2ed410def"
										class="button-effect-blue mob-show-only w-inline-block">
										<div class="btn-text">get notifieD</div>
										<div class="color-btns"></div>
									</a>
								</div>
								<div class="content-block-2 sticky-content-blk">
									<h3 class="h3">Customizable Preferences</h3>
									<div class="sticky-par">
										<p class="paragraph">Our intelligent search adapts to your visa status, country
											of origin, career goals, and immigration timeline to surface the most
											relevant legal guidance, deadlines, and real opportunities. <br><br>
											Your IA help you find the path that fits your situation and support you at
											every
											step forward</p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="content-block-3 sticky-content-blk">
									<h3 class="h3">Entry . Stay.<br />Extend </h3>
									<div class="sticky-par">
										<p class="paragraph">Your assistant understands the many paths within the
											immigration system and helps you navigate them, from immediate status
											protection to future residency planning. <br><br>
											Your IA is here provide clarity, direction, and steady support whenever you
											need it.</p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="content-block-4 sticky-content-blk">
									<h3 class="h3">You <br />deserve</h3>
									<div class="sticky-par">
										<p class="paragraph">No matter your race, nationality, or background, you
											deserve fair access to clear immigration information and real opportunity.
											<br><br>
											Your IA is built to support communities who have been historically
											overlooked or excluded, and we are committed to equity in every step of your
											journey.
										</p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="content-block-5 sticky-content-blk">
									<h3 class="h3">Meet Garvey AI</h3>
									<div class="sticky-par">
										<p class="paragraph">Garvey AI understands your status, tracks changing
											immigration updates, monitors visa slots, and analyzes your files so you
											always receive relevant, up to date support without sacrificing privacy.
											Garvey lives locally in your app, and its knowledge is exclusive to only
											you.

